interests.interest:
The Member has received loans totalling £124,000.  The loans are personal and not commercial in nature.  They are initially for a period of five years (which can be extended) and are not interest-bearing.  The repayments term begins in January 2013.  Repayments are not of a regular fixed amount.  The sources of the loans are as follows:
Lord Alli, London WC2 (£62,000);
Mr F Nahdi, Wembley, Middlesex (£52,000);
Mr S Ismail and Mr M Ali, Islam Channel, London EC2 (£10,000) (interest ceased 22 June 2017)
